A.In 2022, under the strong leadership of the prefectural Party committee and the provincial procuratorate, with the lawful supervision of the prefectural People's Congress and its Standing Committee, the strong support of the prefectural government, the democratic supervision of the prefectural People's Political Consultative Conference, and the care and support from all sectors of society, the procuratorial organs across the prefecture thoroughly studied and implemented Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, earnestly practiced Xi Jinping Thought on the Rule of Law, fully implemented the guiding principles of the 19th and 20th National Congresses of the Communist Party of China, and centered on the decisions and deployments of the prefectural Party committee and the provincial procuratorate. Adhering to the principle of prioritizing stability while pursuing progress, they faithfully performed their legal supervision duties, vigorously promoted the comprehensive, coordinated, and full development of the "Four Major Procuratorial Functions" and "Ten Major Services," achieving new results in all aspects of their work.  

Throughout the year, a total of 19,245 cases of various types were handled, representing an 18.9% increase year-on-year. Among them:  
- Criminal procuratorial cases totaled 17,051, up 17.5% year-on-year;  
- Civil procuratorial cases numbered 527, up 16.6% year-on-year;  
- Administrative procuratorial cases reached 297, up 68.8% year-on-year;  
- Public interest litigation procuratorial cases amounted to 920, up 42.2% year-on-year;  
